OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill returns to Garvaghy Road
OL,4,Aas police investigate Sunday's
OL,5,A'unlawful protest'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMichelle O'Neill has said she is
OL,8,Fcomfortable with her choice to protest
OL,9,Fagainst an Orange Order parade on the
OL,10,FGarvaghy Road on Sunday.
OL,12,FThe Sinn Fein first minister attended
OL,13,Fthe protest that blocked the mainly
OL,14,Fnationalist road to prevent the parade
OL,15,Ffrom happening.
OL,17,FOn Wednesday, the PSNI chief constable
OL,18,Fsaid there was a large scale criminal
OL,19,Finvestigation under way into the
OL,20,Funlawful blocking of Garvaghy Road.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
