OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill returns to Garvaghy Road
OL,4,Aas police investigate Sunday's
OL,5,A'unlawful protest'
OL,6,
OL,7,FO'Neill said she understands the law,
OL,8,Fbut chose to "stand in solidarity" with
OL,9,Fresidents.
